Error [E0917]: `factorial` calls itself, so `@InlineAlways` cannot expand it
  --> tests/ui/inline_always_recursive.jet:2:1
    |
  2 | @InlineAlways fn factorial(n: Int) -> Int {
    | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: inlining a recursive call would either loop forever at compile time or require an artificial depth cutoff — neither is a real inline.
 Fix: drop `@InlineAlways` (use `@Inline` as a hint), or restructure the function to be non-recursive.
